msgid "Interlink Simulator Controller Emulation with OpenTX"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/interlink-emulation.rst:7
#: e3d20e5c6bed4131886528288fdcd527
msgid "It is possible to closely emulate the Interlink DX or Elite with an OpenTX transmitter in RealFlight. This allows using your existing OpenTX transmitter if RealFlight software only is purchased. Since the ArduPilot SITL models for use with RealFlight assume that an Interlink DX is being used, setting up your OpenTX transmitter to exactly emulate it prevents having to change any transmitter settings for its use."
msgstr ""

